; BCE (ride-along) — the project pins prettier@2.x while @nestjs/schematics@11 lists an OPTIONAL
; peer prettier@^3; npm 11 ERESOLVE-errors on that benign optional-peer conflict. Declare legacy peer
; resolution so `npm install` is consistent (no per-command --legacy-peer-deps, which was pruning the
; gitignored smoke harness's unsaved puppeteer-core — now tracked as a devDependency). A prettier@3
; bump (which would reformat the whole tree) is the alternative, deferred.
legacy-peer-deps=true
